msgstr "Pengaturan {#setup}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, import the required packages and tools.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, impor paket dan alat yang diperlukan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define your [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) credentials, which will be used throughout the tutorial to authenticate to IBM Quantum Compute Service and Qiskit Functions.\n"
msgstr "Definisikan kredensial [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/) Anda, yang akan digunakan sepanjang tutorial ini untuk mengautentikasi ke IBM Quantum Compute Service dan Qiskit Functions.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Define the problem as an objective function {#step-1-define-the-problem-as-an-objective-function}"
msgstr "Langkah 1: Definisikan masalah sebagai fungsi objektif {#step-1-define-the-problem-as-an-objective-function}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Optimization Solver accepts either an objective function or a graph as input. In this tutorial, the Ising spin glass minimization problem is defined as an objective function, and it has been tailored for the heavy-hex topology of IBM&reg; devices.\n"
msgstr "Optimization Solver menerima fungsi objektif atau graf sebagai input. Dalam tutorial ini, masalah minimasi spin glass Ising didefinisikan sebagai fungsi objektif, dan telah disesuaikan untuk topologi heavy-hex dari perangkat IBM&reg;.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because this objective function contains cubic, quadratic, and linear terms, it falls into the HOBO class of problems, known to be considerably more complicated to solve than conventional quadratic unconstrained binary optimization (QUBO) problems.\n"
msgstr "Karena fungsi objektif ini mengandung suku kubik, kuadratik, dan linier, masalah ini termasuk dalam kelas HOBO, yang diketahui jauh lebih rumit untuk diselesaikan dibandingkan masalah optimisasi biner tak terkendala kuadratik (QUBO) konvensional.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For detailed discussion of the construction of the problem definition and previous results obtained from the Optimization Solver refer to [this technical manuscript](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.01743). The problem was originally defined and evaluated as part of a [paper published by Los Alamos National Laboratory](https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.00997), and it has been adapted to leverage the full device width of the 156-qubit IBM Quantum Heron processors.\n"
msgstr "Untuk diskusi detail tentang konstruksi definisi masalah dan hasil sebelumnya yang diperoleh dari Optimization Solver, lihat [manuskrip teknis ini](https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.01743). Masalah ini awalnya didefinisikan dan dievaluasi sebagai bagian dari [makalah yang diterbitkan oleh Los Alamos National Laboratory](https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.00997), dan telah diadaptasi untuk memanfaatkan lebar perangkat penuh dari prosesor IBM Quantum Heron 156-qubit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Run the hybrid algorithm using the Fire Opal Optimization Solver {#step-2-run-the-hybrid-algorithm-using-the-fire-opal-optimization-solver}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Jalankan algoritma hybrid menggunakan Fire Opal Optimization Solver {#step-2-run-the-hybrid-algorithm-using-the-fire-opal-optimization-solver}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now use the Optimization Solver Qiskit Function to run the algorithm. Behind the scenes, the Optimization Solver takes care of mapping the problem to a hybrid quantum algorithm, running the quantum circuits with error suppression, and performing the classical optimization.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang gunakan Qiskit Function Optimization Solver untuk menjalankan algoritma. Di balik layar, Optimization Solver secara otomatis menangani pemetaan masalah ke algoritma quantum hybrid, menjalankan sirkuit quantum dengan suppression error, dan melakukan optimasi klasikal.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check to ensure that the chosen device has at least 156 qubits.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan perangkat yang dipilih memiliki setidaknya 156 qubit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Solver accepts a string representation of the objective function.\n"
msgstr "Solver menerima representasi string dari fungsi objektif.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the familiar [Qiskit Serverless APIs](/guides/serverless) to check your Qiskit Function workload's status:\n"
msgstr "Anda bisa menggunakan [Qiskit Serverless APIs](/guides/serverless) yang sudah familiar untuk mengecek status workload Qiskit Function Anda:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Solver returns a dictionary with the solution and associated metadata, such as the solution bitstring, number of iterations, and mapping of variables to bitstring. For a full definition of the Solver's inputs and outputs, check out the [documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/q-ctrl-optimization-solver).\n"
msgstr "Solver mengembalikan dictionary berisi solusi dan metadata terkait, seperti bitstring solusi, jumlah iterasi, dan pemetaan variabel ke bitstring. Untuk definisi lengkap input dan output Solver, lihat [dokumentasinya](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/q-ctrl-optimization-solver).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Evaluate results {#step-3-evaluate-results}"
msgstr "Langkah 3: Evaluasi hasil {#step-3-evaluate-results}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Solver found the correct solution, which was validated using classical optimization software. The complexity of this utility-scale problem requires an advanced optimization software to be solved classically, such as [IBM ILOG CPLEX Optimization Studio (CPLEX)](https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio) or [Gurobi Optimization](https://www.gurobi.com/).\n"
"As a visual analysis of the quality of results, you can plot the results by calculating the cost values from the bitstrings and their probabilities. For comparison, plot the results alongside a distribution of randomly sampled bitstrings, which is equivalent to a \"brute-force\" classical solution. If the algorithm consistently finds lower costs, it suggests the quantum algorithm is effectively solving the optimization problem.\n"
msgstr "Solver berhasil menemukan solusi yang benar, yang telah divalidasi menggunakan perangkat lunak optimasi klasikal. Kompleksitas masalah skala utilitas ini memerlukan perangkat lunak optimasi canggih untuk diselesaikan secara klasikal, seperti [IBM ILOG CPLEX Optimization Studio (CPLEX)](https://www.ibm.com/products/ilog-cplex-optimization-studio) atau [Gurobi Optimization](https://www.gurobi.com/).\n"

